Key Interview Insights (Important)
1. Before vs After Trigger
Type	Use Case
Before	Modify data
After	Related records / external actions
2. Why No DML in Before Trigger?
Record not saved yet
Direct modification is faster
3. Recursive Trigger Problem
update accounts;

Inside trigger → causes infinite loop

Solution:
Static variables
4. Mixed Automation Problem

If you use:

Trigger + Flow + Workflow

👉 Execution becomes complex → debugging nightmare

